7,"itemIdentity":"requirement:6f68a945-355d-6c87-0a47-b193d486ab05","objective":"When the person presses Start after selecting a doneness, a countdown begins for the selected doneness, starting from the doneness\u0027s full duration.","requirements":[{"requirementIdentity":"6f68a945-355d-6c87-0a47-b193d486ab05","kind":"behavioural_outcome","modality":"obligation","statement":"When the person presses Start after selecting a doneness, a countdown begins for the selected doneness, starting from the doneness\u0027s full duration.","change":"added","prohibitionIntent":"unstated"}],"prerequisiteItemIdentities":[]},{"sequence":8,"itemIdentity":"requirement:713a8aca-388e-be24-9fb7-b407a6ae0a79","objective":"When the person selects an option on the egg timer page, that option is marked as the current choice.","requirements":[{"requirementIdentity":"713a8aca-388e-be24-9fb7-b407a6ae0a79","kind":"behavioural_outcome","modality":"obligation","statement":"When the person selects an option on the egg timer page, that option is marked as the current choice.","change":"added","prohibitionIntent":"unstated"}],"prerequisiteItemIdentities":[]},{"sequence":9,"itemIdentity":"requirement:732d1902-fbcf-9af7-fbce-f62f61dede5a","objective":"The countdown for soft boiled lasts 6 minutes, starting at 6 minutes 00 seconds.","requirements":[{"requirementIdentity":"732d1902-fbcf-9af7-fbce-f62f61dede5a","kind":"behavioural_outcome","modality":"obligation","statement":"The countdown for soft boiled lasts 6 minutes, starting at 6 minutes 00 seconds.","change":"added","prohibitionIntent":"unstated"}],"prerequisiteItemIdentities":[]},{"sequence":10,"itemIdentity":"requirement:c752f094-9d9b-e948-f300-ad6f174efd1e","objective":"When the countdown reaches zero, the page shows a message that the egg is ready.","requirements":[{"requirementIdentity":"c752f094-9d9b-e948-f300-ad6f174efd1e","kind":"behavioural_outcome","modality":"obligation","statement":"When the countdown reaches zero, the page shows a message that the egg is ready.","change":"added","prohibitionIntent":"unstated"}],"prerequisiteItemIdentities":[]},{"sequence":11,"itemIdentity":"requirement:ddaa8fee-ca0d-e849-77b8-b360b3b129de","objective":"When the egg page loads and no further action is taken, a single egg emoji appears centered on the page, with no state mutations and no inputs.","requirements":[{"requirementIdentity":"ddaa8fee-ca0d-e849-77b8-b360b3b129de","kind":"behavioural_outcome","modality":"obligation","statement":"When the egg page loads and no further action is taken, a single egg emoji appears centered on the page, with no state mutations and no inputs.","change":"added","prohibitionIntent":"unstated"}],"prerequisiteItemIdentities":[]},{"sequence":12,"itemIdentity":"requirement:dfe772b8-2148-0e05-3562-37630e568ec4","objective":"The egg timer page shows three options labelled soft, medium, and hard boiled when the page loads and no further action is taken.","requirements":[{"requirementIdentity":"dfe772b8-2148-0e05-3562-37630e568ec4","kind":"behavioural_outcome","modality":"obligation","statement":"The egg timer page shows three options labelled soft, medium, and hard boiled when the page loads and no further action is taken.","change":"added","prohibitionIntent":"unstated"}],"prerequisiteItemIdentities":[]}],"specificationIntents":[{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md","purpose":"# Feature\n\nA page shows one egg emoji in the middle. Below it, the word \u0027Eggs\u0027 appears in sans-serif text.\n\n# Intention \u0026 objectives\n\nThe page lets a visitor see an egg emoji centered on the screen. The word \u0027Eggs\u0027 sits under it in a plain sans-serif typeface."},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-timer/egg-timer.spec.md","purpose":"# Feature\n\nA page where a person picks how to boil their egg \u2014 soft, medium, or hard \u2014 starts a countdown, and sees a clear message when the egg is ready.\n\nThe egg timer page adopts the \u0060eggs-web\u0060 blueprint.\n\n# Intention \u0026 objectives\n\nLet a person know how long to boil their egg and when to take it out, on one small page. The person picks a doneness, presses Start, watches a countdown, and reads a message when the egg is ready."}],"sourceEvidence":[{"fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md:fragment:sha256:0f9061a71a6dfce27995b7f5c72c46456858265307fb767a5327b067487d5381:sha256:10d593a64a90150f8152057c9809a4ee9b3633c3cba7f72637872e2fcf569e65:0of1","documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md","startLine":8,"endLine":8,"exactTextDigest":"sha256:0f9061a71a6dfce27995b7f5c72c46456858265307fb767a5327b067487d5381","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:0f9061a71a6dfce27995b7f5c72c46456858265307fb767a5327b067487d5381","exactText":"A page shows one egg emoji in the middle. Below it, the word \u0027Eggs\u0027 appears in sans-serif text.","requirementIdentities":["46bfab12-9539-c895-4481-b3acdd6d7800","ddaa8fee-ca0d-e849-77b8-b360b3b129de"]},{"fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md:fragment:sha256:01ae35b8ebc033617d0024145270e5ed3787aea0f7976665eb5f849cc9c2e958:sha256:760f420cf1f3bbdaa87049ca281f106dc2700ea7fcc7b587e340eda293899811:0of1","documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md","startLine":11,"endLine":11,"exactTextDigest":"sha256:01ae35b8ebc033617d0024145270e5ed3787aea0f7976665eb5f849cc9c2e958","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:01ae35b8ebc033617d0024145270e5ed3787aea0f7976665eb5f849cc9c2e958","exactText":"The page lets a visitor see an egg emoji centered on the screen. The word \u0027Eggs\u0027 sits under it in a plain sans-serif typeface.","requirementIdentities":["46bfab12-9539-c895-4481-b3acdd6d7800","ddaa8fee-ca0d-e849-77b8-b360b3b129de"]},{"fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.s